  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given that reaction is first order with respect to X and of zero order with respect to Y.</p><p>Means&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mfenced><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></mfenced><mn>0</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;Where k = rate constant.</p><p>Using data&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math>&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>II</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mn>0</mn></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Using data from&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math>&nbsp;&amp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>III</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p>Not the ratio which is asked in question</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
